  "text": "proprium.dominica-post-ascensionem-communio",
  "about": "The communio of the formulary “Sunday after Ascension” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": { "translation": "Father, while I was with them, I kept those whom Thou gavest Me, alleluia. But now I come to Thee. I pray not that Thou shouldst take them out of the world, but that Thou shouldst keep them from evil, alleluia, alleluia." }
